				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				12.3
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, πρὸς ἔρωτας ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
